{
  "\"Play calm theme when there's 4 or less enemies around. Unless there's more that one Insurrectionist or more than 2 Mindflayers\".": "周围敌人不超过 4 个时播放平静主题。除非周围有超过 1 个 Insurrectionist 或超过 2 个 Mindflayer。",
  "1. Open the folder that contains the mod executables. <color=#FAEDB8>Click here to open it</color>\n2. Download <b>yt-dlp</b> <color=#FAEDB8>from here</color> at move it into the previously opened folder\n3. Download <b>ffmpeg</b> <color=#FAEDB8>from here</color> and extract ffmpeg.exe from the archive into the previously opened folder\n4. Download <b>ffprobe</b> <color=#FAEDB8>from here</color> and extract ffprobe.exe from the archive into the previously opened folder\n\nPress RESTART once you've completed all of the above. Press Close to close this window": "1. 打开包含 mod 可执行文件的文件夹。<color=#FAEDB8>点击此处打开</color>\n2. 从<color=#FAEDB8>此处</color>下载 <b>yt-dlp</b> 并移动到刚才打开的文件夹\n3. 从<color=#FAEDB8>此处</color>下载 <b>ffmpeg</b>，把压缩包里的 ffmpeg.exe 解压到刚才打开的文件夹\n4. 从<color=#FAEDB8>此处</color>下载 <b>ffprobe</b>，把压缩包里的 ffprobe.exe 解压到刚才打开的文件夹\n\n全部完成后按「重启」。按「关闭」关闭此窗口",
  "2.3.0 Update": "2.3.0 更新",
  "<color=red>root@jukebox:/Credits#</color> cd ../SpecialThanks\n<color=red>root@jukebox:/SpecialThanks#</color> ./SpecialThanks.sh\n\nSpecial thanks to UntotenTheo, Net and ayladotcom": "<color=red>root@jukebox:/Credits#</color> cd ../SpecialThanks\n<color=red>root@jukebox:/SpecialThanks#</color> ./SpecialThanks.sh\n\n特别感谢 UntotenTheo、Net 与 ayladotcom",
  "<size=24>CUSTOM TRACKS</size>\n\nAlright, but what about custom tracks?\n\nWell, to create such a track, use the same technique as for intros and loops: postfixes in your track file name.\nAny track is treated as a \"battle theme\" by default. To add its calm variation, add another, similarly named track with <b><i>_calm</i></b> postfix.\n\n<b>Music.mp3            - A battle theme of the track\nMusic_calm.mp3 - A calm theme of the track</b>\n\nAnd what about segmented tracks? They already contain two files! How do I even make a calm variation to its intro and loop? Can I add a calm theme only to loop or only to intro specifically?\n\nYes you can. Customize it the way you want.\n\n<b>Music_calmintro.mp3  - A calm variation of the intro section\nMusic_intro.mp3      - A battle variation of the intro\nMusic_calmloop.mp3   - A calm variation of the main part\nMusic.mp3 - A battle version of the main part</b>\n\nAnd yes, all these files will be treated as a single track in the Terminal": "<size=24>自定义曲目</size>\n\n那么，自定义曲目呢？\n\n做法和前奏/循环一样：在文件名里加后缀。\n任何曲目默认都被视为「战斗主题」。要给它加平静变体，就再放一个同名曲目，加 <b><i>_calm</i></b> 后缀。\n\n<b>Music.mp3            - 该曲目的战斗主题\nMusic_calm.mp3 - 该曲目的平静主题</b>\n\n那分段曲目呢？它们本来就有两个文件！怎么给它们的前奏和循环分别做平静变体？可以只给循环或只给前奏加平静主题吗？\n\n当然可以，随你定制。\n\n<b>Music_calmintro.mp3  - 前奏部分的平静变体\nMusic_intro.mp3      - 前奏部分的战斗变体\nMusic_calmloop.mp3   - 主体部分的平静变体\nMusic.mp3 - 主体部分的战斗变体</b>\n\n而且，这些文件在终端里会被视为同一首曲目",
  "A new <color=#FAEDB8>yt-dlp</color> version is available, press Update to download it from the official source. This step is mandatory as without this update Downloader might not function properly.": "有新的 <color=#FAEDB8>yt-dlp</color> 版本可用，按「更新」从官方来源下载。此步骤是必需的，否则下载器可能无法正常工作。",
