  "Now playing": "正在播放",
  "Now you can download your songs directly from <color=red>YouTube</color> by simply providing a URL to a song or playlist. Downloaded songs will be saved inside the <b>YouTube</b> folder in Cybergrind terminal and you can add them into your playlist right away be Refreshing the page.\n\n<b>Downloader is powered by a 3-rd party software such as ffmpeg and yt-dlp which you will be offered to download and install automatically. You're at liberty not to do so, but in this case this functionality won't be available</b>\n\nThe flow should be straightforward enough, but here's a couple of things to consider:\n\n1. YouTube may or may not want you to get logged in\n\nDepending on a network you're trying to download your songs from, YouTube might decline your requests unless you're logged in. The mod will let you know if that's the case and will provide a set of instructions on how to overcome this issue, or you can <color=#FAEDB8>click here</color> to see these instructions. \n\n2. No matter how hard I try there's a bunch of tracks I just can't download. Why?\n\nIt could be many things. Age restriction, sensitive topics. Hell, some videos are just deleted for good, you're not gonna get these.\n\n3. I seem not to be able to download any of them\n\nSee p. 1, most likely you need to refresh your cookies": "现在你可以直接从 <color=red>YouTube</color> 下载歌曲，只需提供歌曲或播放列表的 URL。下载的歌曲会保存在 Cybergrind 终端的 <b>YouTube</b> 文件夹里，刷新页面后就能加入播放列表。\n\n<b>下载器依赖 ffmpeg、yt-dlp 等第三方软件，届时会提示你自动下载安装。你也可以拒绝，但那样此功能将不可用</b>\n\n流程应该足够直观，不过有几点要注意：\n\n1. YouTube 可能要求你登录\n\n取决于你下载歌曲时使用的网络，YouTube 可能拒绝你的请求，除非你已登录。mod 会提示你，并提供解决说明，或者你也可以 <color=#FAEDB8>点击这里</color> 查看说明。 \n\n2. 不管我怎么试，总有一堆曲目下载不下来，为什么？\n\n原因可能很多：年龄限制、敏感内容。见鬼，有些视频就是被永久删除了，你也拿不到。\n\n3. 好像一首都没法下载\n\n见第 1 条，多半是需要刷新你的 cookies",
