  "Show current track panel indefinitely": "常驻显示当前曲目面板",
  "Similarly to the original ULTRAKILL score, you can add a segmented track to your playlist so it would have an intro and loop parts.\n\nIf you have two identically named tracks with <b><i>_intro</i></b> and <b><i>_loop</i></b> postfixes, these files will be treated as a single track with intro and loop parts.\n<b>\nMusic_intro.mp3      - An intro part\nMusic_loop.mp3 - A main loop part\n</b>": "和原版 ULTRAKILL 配乐类似，你可以往播放列表里添加分段曲目，让它拥有前奏和循环部分。\n\n如果你有两个同名曲目，分别带 <b><i>_intro</i></b> 和 <b><i>_loop</i></b> 后缀，它们会被视为一首带前奏与循环的曲目。\n<b>\nMusic_intro.mp3      - 前奏部分\nMusic_loop.mp3 - 主循环部分\n</b>",
  "Something went wrong": "出错了",
  "Sound Effects": "音效",
  "Soundtrack": "原声带",
  "Terminal music": "终端音乐",
  "Themes": "主题",
  "This menu will allow you to switch songs mid-game. Start playing Cyber Grind in order for the song list to appear.": "本菜单让你在游戏中切换歌曲。进入 Cyber Grind 开始游戏后，歌曲列表才会出现。",
  "This section will allow you to download tracks directly from <color=red>YouTube</color>, but it requires <color=#FAEDB8>yt-dlp</color> and <color=#FAEDB8>ffmpeg</color> to be installed in order to work properly.\n\nThese tools will be downloaded from their official sources and installed automatically into the folder with the mod binaries.\n\nThen, the Downloader section will appear right off.": "本节允许你直接从 <color=red>YouTube</color> 下载曲目，但需要安装 <color=#FAEDB8>yt-dlp</color> 和 <color=#FAEDB8>ffmpeg</color> 才能正常工作。\n\n这些工具会从官方来源下载，并自动安装到 mod 可执行文件所在的文件夹。\n\n之后，下载器区域就会直接出现。",
  "This update introduces subtitle support, a <color=#90E3D1>Thorn</color> integration with 3 modules for you to use (check <b>Thorn menu </b>> <b>HUD</b>), and a ton of bug fixes.": "本次更新加入字幕支持、<color=#90E3D1>Thorn</color> 集成（3 个模块，见 <b>Thorn 菜单</b> > <b>HUD</b>），以及大量错误修复。",
  "UP/DOWN/LEFT/RIGHT": "上/下/左/右",
  "UPDATE": "更新",
  "Wave complete": "波次完成",
  "You died": "你死了",
  "You know how in original ULTRAKILL campaign there's a light, calm theme playing when there are no enemies around, followed by an intense variation once the battle has started?\nNow you can enable it in Cyber Grind for original ULTRAKILL soundtrack and create your own tracks.\n\nBut unlike the campaign mode, you can decide when to play the calm theme by yourself (otherwise it would've been stupid since enemies are almost always present in Cyber Grind).\nGo to <b>Themes</b> tab and you'll see three controls:\n\n1. <b>Enable calm themes</b>: disable if you're not interested in this feature\n2. <b>Enemies threshold for calm theme to play</b>: the battle theme will play unless there's less or equal enemies currently alive\n3. <b>Play battle theme when there's <= N of these enemies around</b>: enemies threshold may be a reliable way to control when the calm theme is playing, but what if, say, these two enemies who's left are Mindflayer and Insurrectionist? Is it really a good occasion to switch to the calm theme?\nThat's why you can change a threshold for each enemy individually or disable it.\n\n<b>N.B.!</b> There's quite a difference between conventional enemies and their radiant counterparts, that's why radiant enemies are configured in their own respective tab.": "你知道原版 ULTRAKILL 战役里，在没有敌人时会播放一段轻柔的平静主题，战斗开始后切换成激烈的变奏吗？\n现在你可以在 Cyber Grind 里为原版 ULTRAKILL 原声启用这个机制，也可以自己制作曲目。\n\n不过和战役模式不同，你可以自己决定何时播放平静主题（否则会很蠢，因为 Cyber Grind 里几乎总有敌人）。\n打开 <b>Themes</b> 页，你会看到三个控件：\n\n1. <b>Enable calm themes</b>：不想要这个功能就关掉\n2. <b>Enemies threshold for calm theme to play</b>：除非当前存活敌人数小于等于该值，否则播放战斗主题\n3. <b>Play battle theme when there's <= N of these enemies around</b>：敌人数量阈值是控制平静主题的可靠方式，但假如剩下的两个敌人是 Mindflayer 和 Insurrectionist 呢？这真的是切到平静主题的好时机吗？\n所以你可以单独调整每种敌人的阈值，或者直接禁用。\n\n<b>注意！</b> 普通敌人和它们的镭射版本差别很大，所以镭射敌人有各自独立的页签。",
  "YouTube's issued a <i>Sign in to confirm you're not a bot</i> error\r\n\r\nThis usually happens when YouTube detects a high activity from your network - a situation that often occurs when using a VPN\t\n\r\nThere is a solution for this, <b>but I highly recommend using a fresh, dedicated Google account</b>\r\n\r\n1. Open YouTube in your browser. Make sure you're logged in (also it's paramount the YouTube tab is freshly opened)\r\n2. Open the cookie exporter application. Export your cookies in Netscape format into <b>cookies.txt</b> file in <color=#FAEDB8>this folder</color> (click to open)\r\n3. If you don't have a cookie exporter installed, use one of these options depending on your browser:\n\r\nChrome: <color=#FAEDB8>Get cookies.txt locally\r</color>\nFirefox: <color=#FAEDB8>Export Cookies</color>\n\nIf everything is done correctly, the Downloader should work the next time you enter a video / playlist URL": "YouTube 报出 <i>Sign in to confirm you're not a bot</i> 错误\n\n这通常发生在 YouTube 检测到你的网络有高活动量时——使用 VPN 时很常见\n\n有解决办法，<b>但我非常建议使用一个全新的专用 Google 账号</b>\n\n1. 在浏览器中打开 YouTube，确保已登录（而且务必是新打开的 YouTube 标签页）\n2. 打开 cookie 导出工具，把 cookies 以 Netscape 格式导出为 <b>cookies.txt</b>，放到<color=#FAEDB8>此文件夹</color>（点击打开）\n3. 如果没装 cookie 导出工具，按浏览器选择：\n\nChrome：<color=#FAEDB8>Get cookies.txt locally</color>\nFirefox：<color=#FAEDB8>Export Cookies</color>\n\n如果一切正确，下次输入视频/播放列表 URL 时下载器应该就能工作",
  "[ EMPTY ]": "[ 空 ]",
